{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260524025309dc3cff9d58cf4bb4","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-5.1","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a thorough understanding of the project. Let me create the M6 milestone content:\n\n1. **ch5.json** - Chapter 5 data: 判官殿 (Judge's Palace) - the final chapter with all storylines converging\n2. **EndingSystem.ts** - Multi-ending system based on choices across all chapters\n3. **Update ChapterManager.ts** - to support ch5 and ending evaluation\n4. **Update characters.json** - add new Ch5 characters (陆判官/陆无咎 as a real character, etc.)\n5. **Update scenes.json** - add new Ch5 scenes (判官殿, 大慈恩寺深度, etc.)\n6. **Update package.json** - version 0.6.0\n\nLet me design Ch5 based on the GDD:\n\nCh5: 判官殿（终章）\n- All dark threads converge - 铜符、封印、地下组织、陆判官真实身份\n- Ultimate puzzle requiring connections from all 4 previous chapters\n- Truth: 陆判官 not evil but guarding a secret that could overturn the Tang dynasty\n- 3 main endings + 2 hidden endings based on choices\n\nNew scenes needed:\n- 判官殿 (陆判官的宫殿 - dream/vision/underground)\n- 大慈恩寺·藏经阁 (hidden library)\n- 封印之间 (seal chamber)\n- 长安城·全景 (panoramic Chang'an)\n- 真相之间 (truth chamber)\n\nNew characters:\n- 陆无咎 as a real interactive character\n- Maybe an old monk\n- The final antagonist\n\nLet me now create all the files needed.\n\nI'll need to create:\n1. src/data/chapters/ch5.json - Full chapter data with 30+ dialogue nodes, 12+ evidence, 3-5 NPC interrogations, 14+ trial testimonies\n2. src/game/EndingSystem.ts - Multi-ending evaluation system\n3. Update src/game/ChapterManager.ts - to integrate ending system\n4. Update src/data/characters.json - add Ch5 characters\n5. Update src/data/scenes.json - add Ch5 scenes\n6. Update package.json - version 0.6.0\n\nLet me start creating all the files now.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"sessio